      "id": 56669,
      "name": "Rabit",
      "username": "Rabit",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/rabit/{size}/7330_2.png",
      "created_at": "2013-03-27T17:29:13.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>They are not random. Christopher specifically chose those values to create interesting choices while ensuring a specific distritubution of the numbers. For example, you'll notice that no&nbsp;card&nbsp;has a repeat of numbers for that card; you won't see a card that has two instances with the same spell number. This gives you the opportunity to consider which cards you want to cast/discard, if you have more than one in your hand or know there are more to come...</p>",
      "post_number": 4,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T02:31:46.524Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
